  steps: ["P|20|Simmer the pork belly in salted water until cooked through; cool and slice thinly.", "A|5|Boil shrimp 2 minutes, cool, peel and halve lengthwise.", "A|5|Cook vermicelli per package, rinse in cold water and drain well.", "A|10|Wash and dry herbs and lettuce; set up a rolling station.", "A|25|Dip rice paper in warm water 2 seconds, lay flat. Place shrimp (pink side down) first, then lettuce, herbs, noodles, pork. Fold sides in, roll tightly, tuck in a chive.", "A|5|Sauce: fry garlic in a little oil, add hoisin, peanut butter and water to thin; top with peanuts."],
