  steps: ["P|20|Soak kombu in the water (or overnight in the fridge for best flavor).", "A|5|Heat slowly; remove kombu just before it boils (boiling makes it slimy).", "P|3|Add katsuobushi, turn off heat and let it sink.", "A|3|Strain through a fine sieve — don't squeeze the flakes. This is dashi.", "A|3|Rehydrate wakame; cube tofu; slice scallions.", "A|3|Warm dashi, add tofu and wakame. Dissolve miso in a ladle of broth, then stir back in. Do not boil after adding miso."],
